+/// HST Office: a context that holds beside the shell's context, e.g. the cursor in a Writer header
+/// or footer, where the shell's context stays Text (or Table). The Tabbed notebookbar of the frame of
+/// rWindow shows the tabs of eSub next to those of the current context and opens the first of them;
+/// Context::Unknown ends it. It is not sent to the sidebar, whose decks follow the shell's context.
+/// Does nothing on a frame without the Tabbed notebookbar.
+VCL_DLLPUBLIC void SetRibbonSubContext(const vcl::Window& rWindow, vcl::EnumContext::Context eSub);
+}
